"Counted on this Mac while you type in other apps: suggestions shown and accepted, the characters you type yourself where autocomplete works, and the pauses between them, by day, kind of app and model. No text, app names or window titles are kept. Time saved is the keystrokes you did not type at your measured speed, not counting time spent reading suggestions." = "Huhesabiwa kwenye Mac hii unapoandika katika programu nyingine: mapendekezo yaliyoonyeshwa na kukubaliwa, herufi unazoandika mwenyewe mahali ukamilishaji otomatiki unapofanya kazi na mapumziko kati yake, kwa siku, aina ya programu na modeli. Hakuna maandishi, majina ya programu au vichwa vya madirisha vinavyohifadhiwa. Muda uliookolewa ni muda wa mibonyezo ya vitufe ambayo hukuandika kwa kasi yako iliyopimwa, bila kuhesabu muda uliotumia kusoma mapendekezo.";
